{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1483646-shout-out-to-the-writers","id":1483646,"title":"Shout out to the Writers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-10T13:18:24-07:00","id":1483646,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon7.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Shout out to the Writers","content":"I had been away from Exalted 3rd since my regular gaming group had a game implode and many people attributed that to the clunky Solar charm set near when the books came out. I didn't buy the Dragonblooded or Lunar book because I was in mourning about not getting to play it. I backed the Exigent Indiegogo project and looked through the charms written for Janest and was floored with how much more tweaked and clean the charm trees felt.<br /> <br /> This led me to go back and read Lunars, which I found that the charm set was similarly excellent in comparison. Now, I am geeked about Exalted again and even building an Exigent charm set in my off time. I bought a copy of Lunars from Drivethru RPG and have been bugging my group about Exalted again. So while I may be forever sad because I don't think they will come back to it, I wanted to give the writers some serious kudos for shifting the design mentality for later books.<br /> <br /> If anyone has some suggestions for homebrew fixes to the Solar charm set (minimizing the dice tricks and addressing the heavy bloat in several trees) I would love to hear them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1333-wednesday","name":"Wednesday","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-11T00:30:51-07:00","id":1483698,"title":"","content":"A revised Solar Charmset by Vance has long been floated on a lot of people\u2019s wishlist for 3e","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}